### Error Test - Invalid Transformation Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transform
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "Test text",
    "transformation_type": "invalid_type",
    "ai_provider": "gemini"
}

### Error Test - Empty Text
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transform
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "",
    "transformation_type": "tone",
    "tone_x": -50,
    "tone_y": 0,
    "ai_provider": "gemini"
}

### Error Test - Invalid Tone Coordinates (Out of Range)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transform
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "Test text",
    "transformation_type": "tone",
    "tone_x": 150,
    "tone_y": -200,
    "ai_provider": "gemini"
}